## FIX 3 — remove `PartialOrd, Ord` from BindCover's derives

Nothing orders BindCover (the three constructing sites pass `Full`;
`covers()` is the only consumer — your verification). Unconsumed surface
comes out; a future round that needs ordering re-adds the derive WITH its
consumer.

OLD (`placement.rs:187-189`):
```rust
#[derive(
    Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, PartialOrd, Ord, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize,
)]
```

NEW:
```rust
#[derive(
    Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize,
)]
```

(rustfmt collapses this to the single-line derive — 78 chars, fits.)

